22 year old daniel van heist is  described by those who knew him best as  the kind of soul you would ever meet  neighbors of his family in the small  town of verona are echoing that  statement as they grieve his sudden  death  every village has that one kid that will  go above and beyond to help anybody or  anything  and on that day that this incident  happened we lost that child  adam mori is a neighbor of the van heist  family and says daniel was always  helping others on one occasion mori says  daniel helped his wife after she  collapsed with heat stroke in front of  their family home he ran it with a  bottle of water and helped her and  stayed with her until i got back and  stories just like maurice have poured  onto social media in the form of  tributes to remember the young man who  was passionate about his job as an  arborist i ran a small tree service for  years  and i know how dangerous that equipment  is and it's it's just sad that it  happened the way it did  van heist was working with his employer  eco tree care on a contract with the  city of oshawa to remove ash trees  officials say just before 9 a.m  wednesday morning a piece of heavy  equipment killed an employee later  identified as van heist those who work  at the verona run family business did a  climb friday morning to honor their  fallen colleague  a gofundme site was set up by a family  member and local business owner and in  only eight hours the campaign reached 13  thousand dollars the family is now  asking anyone who would like to make a  donation to do so in person at the bank  of montreal in verona as well as at the  food less traveled grocery store an  investigation into what exactly caused  van gaal's death is ongoing as his  family begins to make funeral  arrangements yet to be announced
 

